2026-08-27 UTC — local paired-end 16S denoising run

Input
- 17 supplied paired collections under data/inputs/paired_input_data.
- 250,607 synchronized read pairs were inspected. Forward/reverse IDs matched for all 17 pairs after removing the expected /1 and /2 suffixes.
- Reads were supplied as primer-free; no primer or external reference sequence was used.

Workflow
- DADA2 1.38.0, local native environment /workspace/.denoise.
- filterAndTrim: truncLen=(240,200), maxN=0, maxEE=(2,2), truncQ=2, rm.phix=TRUE, matchIDs=FALSE; mate order was independently verified before filtering.
- Error models learned jointly across all 17 filtered samples.
- Per-sample dada inference with pool=FALSE.
- Paired merging: minOverlap=12, maxMismatch=0, trimOverhang=FALSE.
- removeBimeraDenovo(method="consensus") for de novo chimera removal.

Results
- 236,404 filtered read pairs; 226,971 merged read pairs.
- 513 ASVs before chimera removal; 331 ASVs and 217,670 reads after chimera removal.
- final_answer/asv_abundance.tsv: 331 ASV rows, one sequence column plus the exact 17 supplied sample columns, integer nonnegative raw counts.
- Final table validation passed: unique uppercase ACGT sequences, no missing values, exact sample header match, and no extra files in final_answer.
